# Strategy: ignore everything, then explicitly allow what matters.
# Anything not listed below (binaries, profiles, logs, editor files) stays out.

# 1. Ignore everything
*

# 2. Allow directories so Git can look inside them
!*/

# 3. Go source and module files
!*.go
!go.mod
!go.sum
!go.work
!go.work.sum

# 4. Game assets
!*.vert
!*.frag
!*.glsl
!*.png

# 5. Docs, README media, and project config
!*.md
!*.gif
!LICENSE
!Makefile
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# 6. Re-ignore build output folders (overrides the allow rules above)
bin/
dist/
build/
vendor/

# 7. Explicit binary and artifact patterns (safety net, mostly redundant)
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.o
*.test
*.out
*.prof
*.pprof
